    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’d love to! AI could turn abstract concepts like derivatives into interactive games or visual simulations—something that matches my love for board games and cycling. My non-binary identity might make me curious about tools that feel inclusive, not just academic.",
